+    /**
+     * Installs or clears the custom keybox XML via keystore2 maintenance.
+     *
+     * @return bitmask (0=none, 1=EC, 2=RSA, 3=EC+RSA) or negative ResponseCode/ErrorCode on error.
+     * @hide
